WEBVTT

00:12:57.272 --> 00:13:02.152
The price of stopping a dictator
always goes up with every delay,

00:13:02.194 --> 00:13:03.695
every hesitation.

00:13:03.695 --> 00:13:05.906
Meeting evil halfway,

00:13:05.948 --> 00:13:07.950
it's still a victory for evil.

00:13:09.243 --> 00:13:12.162
Evil tempts us with our weakness,

00:13:12.162 --> 00:13:18.252
with our desire for comfort,
being comfortable,

00:13:18.293 --> 00:13:23.298
cautious, rational, civilized.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:28.929
What kind of civilization
[are we] fighting for,

00:13:28.971 --> 00:13:32.641
if we allow war crimes and genocide again?